  <h1>Call Quality Score (MOS) Prediction &amp; Cell-Level Prioritization</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <strong>Capgemini</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Data Scientist &nbsp;|&nbsp; 12/2020 – 06/2022
  </div>

  <!--<div class="est-note">
